   "resumo_en": "It's a Beautiful Day is the debut album by San Francisco band It's a Beautiful Day. Released by Columbia Records in 1969, the album rose to number 47 on the U.S. LP charts. It remained on the Billboard Top 200 for 70 continuous weeks, and would go on to achieve Gold Record certification in November 1972. This album contains the band's biggest hit song, \"White Bird.\"",
